  "releaseNotes": "v.1.0.0-beta.6\n- Fixes complexPairName didn't parse when contained a dot [#8](https://github.com/MihaMarkic/godot-tscn-parser/issues/8)\nv.1.0.0-beta.5\n- Fixes escaping double quotes in strings (kilian-hu)\nv.1.0.0-beta.4\n- adds support for numeric keys in complex values (used for dictionaries)\nv.1.0.0-beta.3\n- adds generic types support\nv.1.0.0-beta.2\n- adds floating point with scientific notation like 1.87e-02 (jairov4)\n- adds multiple function-like values. pe. PackedByteArray() (jairov4)\n- adds properties with slash like surface_material_override/0 (jairov4)\n- fixes nodePath handling (jairov4)\n- removes numericStructure in favor of more generic predicate\n- removes objectArray in favor of more generic complexValueArray\nv.1.0.0-beta.1\n- adds editable node support\nv.1.0.0-alpha8\n- fixes parsing issues\nv.1.0.0-alpha7\n- adds .godot file parser (project.godot)\nv.1.0.0-alpha6\n- improves grammer to allow easier property name parsing\nv.1.0.0-alpha5\n- renames assembly\nv.1.0.0-alpha4\n- switches to .NET Standard 2.0 to provide support for source generators and .NET Framework based code\nv.1.0.0-alpha1\n- initial version",
